{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nebula Cleanup Crew is a short, roguelike bullet-hell game where you rescue your crew members by defeating waves of enemies leading up to bosses. Once a crew member is rescued you can play as them! The average session will last 3-10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOT AND COLD WARFARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon alters your ship's core temperature as you pave the way to a crew member needing rescue. Superheat or Superchill your ship to use powerful special attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREEZE your enemies, then hit them with SCORCH damage to cause a FLARE blast outward from the enemy. Or, OVERHEAT them and then hit with FROSTBITE damage to create damaging ICE SHRAPNEL and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.poster.avif?t=1761168106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.webm?t=1761168106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/b6e448342f99b5b0de9ae10ca1219adf.mp4?t=1761168106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESCUE THE CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat Nebula Bosses to rescue and unlock your crew members as playable ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.poster.avif?t=1761168106\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.webm?t=1761168106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/8661c3994e4d9478f58b1ff3a0b24a46.mp4?t=1761168106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR WEAPONRY</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change what happens when in SuperTemp Zones! For example, COLD bullets can double in size when fired while you're in a SuperChill Zone! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also upgrade fundamental stats like ammo usage, weapon effects, and your COLD and HOT abilities. Unlock all the options for over 50 total upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.poster.avif?t=1761168106\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/778ba72090be86acb4c06a4852836456.webm?t=1761168106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ hand-crafted maps full of enemies to defeat, including 2 bosses. Each run features different maps and each map has a touch of procedural generation to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be short. Each session will last between 3 and 10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 original music tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stagger enemies with your hot and cold arsenal! Over 50 upgrades for your weaponry, ship stats and abilities - many of them unlocked after completing various challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player, fully offline close-quarters action gameplay: no internet required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a father and son making a game in our off-hours. We\u2019re having a blast designing, coding, and drawing it \u2014 and we hope you have a blast playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/extras/ca91cdded56d5800de19a6a5f09c6cfc.avif?t=1761168106\" width=196 height=167 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432070?t=1761168106","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/0e0da7569b9627ecb7263299766e41ab97cb5233/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761168106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/1d0caf88b0fc4cf9ccaefd4b0811af3d5cd2b37f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761168106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/1d0caf88b0fc4cf9ccaefd4b0811af3d5cd2b37f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761168106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3958810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nebula Cleanup Crew is a short, roguelike bullet-hell game where you rescue your crew members by defeating waves of enemies leading up to bosses. Once a crew member is rescued you can play as them! The average session will last 3-10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOT AND COLD WARFARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wea